# Draft lexicons of the diagram world, generated from the legend of diagram-vss-demo (docs/js/logic.js, createSystem().engine.legend,
# commit 9900d34). One lexicon per legend question that has values. The words are the legend values and their cue words; the
# canonical value of a word comes from the engine at run time (engine.legend.lexicon(key)), so synonyms need no mapping here.
# camelCase values (leftOf, topLeft, mostConnected) are kept only through their cue words. Cue phrases with an ellipsis were dropped.
# Not loaded: this folder is a staging area (see ../README.md).

@lex.diagram.sketch.quantifier core.lexicon
    class=noun
    doc="One specific shape, or all that match? (legend key quantifier, enum; values: all)"
    word=all
    word=every
    word=each
    word=everything

